<ol>
<li>Create an <code>OfflineMapSyncTask</code> with your offline map.</li>
<li>If desired, get <code>OfflineMapUpdatesInfo</code> from the task to che=
ck for update availability or update size.</li>
<li>Get a set of default <code>OfflineMapSyncParameters</code> for the task=
.</li>
<li>Set the parameters to download all available updates.</li>
<li>Use the parameters to create an <code>OfflineMapSyncJob</code>.</li>
<li>Start the job and get the results once it completes successfully.</li>
<li>Check if the mobile map package needs to be reopened, and do so if nece=
ssary.</li>
<li>Finally, display your offline map to see the changes.</li>
</ol>
